# Project Scope

This document explains the scope of xLaDe.
This is written to avoid scope creep in our project.

---

## What xLaDe Is Not

- Proof assistant
- A Lean 4 library like mathlib
- Automated theorem proving supporter for Lean 4
- Dependency of Lean 4
- A substitute of Elan or Lake
- Custom proof verifier of Lean 4

---

## Out of Scope

- Supporting other OSes than Linux
- Verification programme of mathematics
- A GUI application
- Building own proof assistant
- Backward compatibility of Lean 4

